## App header

Keep the brand colour header on key screens, as on the web. It gives each screen a clear starting point and makes the household's interface easy to recognise.

## Use colour with care

Tints inside cards and colours that help people find their way can add structure. Apply colour only where it does not add visual clutter or make the screen harder to use.
